  "releaseNotes": "Added dedicated Boolean, integer, and floating-point hex maps. Integer and floating-point maps provide minimum and maximum queries, copy conversions, and arithmetic operators; Boolean maps provide logical operators. Added conditional selection for Boolean, numeric, and generic maps, deterministic Perlin-noise generation, and Gaussian blur for floating-point hex maps. Expanded public API and map-operation test coverage.",
